#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:6
msgid "Continuous Documentation Deployment"
msgstr "持续文档部署"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:8
msgid ""
"Read the Docs is a *Continuous Documentation Deployment* platform for your "
"software project. Every time you change something in your documentation, "
"Read the Docs will detect your change and build your documentation."
msgstr "Read the Docs 是你软件项目的*持续文档部署*平台。每当你修改文档，Read the Docs 都会检测到变更并构建文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:11
msgid ""
"The Continuous Integration and Continuous Deployment (CI/CD) features are "
"configured with your repository provider, such as GitHub, Bitbucket or "
"GitLab. With each change committed to your repository, we are notified by "
"the configured *webhook*."
msgstr ""
"持续集成和持续部署（CI/CD）功能与你的仓库服务商配置，如 GitHub、Bitbucket 或 GitLab。每次向仓库提交变更，我们都会通过配置的"
" *webhook* 收到通知。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:15
msgid ""
"When we receive a *webhook*, we match it to a project's *Integration*, and "
"the following steps happen:"
msgstr "收到 *webhook* 后，我们将其匹配到项目的 *Integration*，随后发生以下步骤："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:18
msgid ":doc:`Build </builds>` the latest commit."
msgstr ":doc:`构建 </builds>` 最新提交。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:19
msgid ""
"Synchronize your :doc:`versions </versions>` based on the latest tag and "
"branch data in Git."
msgstr "根据 Git 中最新的标签和分支数据同步你的 :doc:`版本 </versions>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:20
msgid "Run your :doc:`automation rules</automation-rules>`."
msgstr "运行你的 :doc:`自动化规则 </automation-rules>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:21
msgid "Auto-cancel any currently running builds of the same version."
msgstr "自动取消同一版本当前正在运行的构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:22
msgid "Add a log entry to the integration's :guilabel:`Recent Activity`."
msgstr "在集成的 :guilabel:`Recent Activity` 中添加日志条目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:25
msgid "Documentation as code"
msgstr "文档即代码"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:27
msgid ""
"Documentation fits into any CI/CD pipeline by following a process known as "
"*Documentation as Code (Docs as code)*. This means that the documentation's "
"life cycle is the same as your software project. By managing these changes "
"in the same life cycle, you can benefit from **documentation and source code"
" being part of the same code review process**."
msgstr ""
"文档通过称为 *Documentation as Code（文档即代码）* 的流程融入任何 CI/CD "
"流水线。这意味着文档的生命周期与软件项目相同。通过在同一生命周期中管理这些变更，你可以从**文档和源代码属于同一代码审查流程**中受益。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:32
msgid ""
"Having an automated and short feedback loop for your documentation allows "
"you to keep it updated with minimal effort. This allows more iteration on "
"documentation, and increases overall value from the documentation you write."
msgstr "为文档建立自动化且短小的反馈循环，让你能以最小的代价保持文档更新。这使文档能更频繁地迭代，提升你编写文档的整体价值。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:37
msgid ""
"As part of this quick feedback loop, you can preview documentation changes "
"immediately using :doc:`pull request previews </pull-requests>`."
msgstr "作为这种快速反馈循环的一部分，你可以使用 :doc:`Pull Request 预览 </pull-requests>` 立即预览文档变更。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:41
msgid "Automated versioning"
msgstr "自动化版本控制"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:43
msgid ""
"With Read the Docs you will be able to fully align your project's **release "
"cycle** with your documentation. For instance, a new version of a software "
"project can build and publish a :doc:`new documentation version "
"</versions>`."
msgstr ""
"使用 Read the Docs，你可以将项目的**发布周期**与文档完全对齐。例如，软件项目的新版本可以构建并发布 :doc:`新文档版本 "
"</versions>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:46
msgid ""
"When you release a new version for your project, you are likely also adding "
"a version tag to your Git repository. These Git events can be configured to "
"build and publish your documentation automatically with :doc:`/automation-"
"rules`. If you use a versioning scheme, you can configure it as part of the "
"automation process."
msgstr ""
"发布项目新版本时，你通常也会给 Git 仓库打上版本标签。这些 Git 事件可配置为通过 :doc:`/automation-rules` "
"自动构建并发布文档。如果你使用版本控制方案，可将其作为自动化流程的一部分进行配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:51
msgid ""
"Whether you choose to handle versioning automatically or with manual control"
" is up to you."
msgstr "选择自动处理版本控制还是手动控制，由你决定。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/continuous-deployment.rst:53
msgid ""
"Read the Docs will store your version history and make it possible for users"
" to visit archived versions of your documentation. Your version setup is "
"ultimately captured by the :term:`flyout menu`, and can be integrated in "
"your documentation with :doc:`/addons`."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 会存储你的版本历史，让用户能访问文档的归档版本。你的版本设置最终由 :term:`flyout menu` 记录，并可通过 "
":doc:`/addons` 集成到文档中。"

